Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.60,0:00:12.00,Title,0,0,0,0,,《斯巴达克斯：血与沙》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.00,0:00:16.00,Title,0,0,0,0,,《传说》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.47,0:01:47.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.50,0:01:51.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的猛攻犹如盲人把烛\N{\fnArial\fs30}You charge without thought.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.41,0:01:55.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,对手会利用这个弱点扭转战局\N{\fnArial\fs30}A weakness an opponent could turn to advantage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.81,0:01:57.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我抓住破绽 主动出击而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}A difficult feat from his backside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.91,0:02:00.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说话也不假思索\N{\fnArial\fs30}You speak without thought as well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.02,0:02:05.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是另一个弱点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Another weakness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.69,0:02:10.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,色雷斯人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thracians.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.32,0:02:12.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,只会仰面朝天 搔首弄姿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Always on their backs with their legs spread.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.63,0:02:15.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟这里格格不入\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where they belong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.33,0:02:19.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,进入了训练场 就得洗心革面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forget everything you learned outside these walls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.73,0:02:22.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,墙外是普通人的世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}For that is the world of men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.40,0:02:24.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不是普通人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are more!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.74,0:02:26.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是角斗士\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are gladiators!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.34,0:02:31.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,学习\N{\fnArial\fs30}Study.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.81,0:02:33.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,训练\N{\fnArial\fs30}Train.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.18,0:02:35.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,流血\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bleed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.38,0:02:38.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,终有一天 你会成为传奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}And one day your name will be legend{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.15,0:02:41.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,令人敬如神明 畏如雷霆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spoken in hushed whispers of fear and awe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.72,0:02:45.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像卡普亚的冠军 克雷斯一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}As the city speaks of Crixus the champion of Capua!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.83,0:02:53.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的威武并不是与生俱来\N{\fnArial\fs30}But his legend was not birthed in the arena.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.07,0:02:55.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是后天铸就\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was given life here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.24,0:02:57.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这个训练场里\N{\fnArial\fs30}In this ludus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.90,0:02:59.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我的皮鞭下淬炼出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Under the sting of my whip!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.38,0:03:03.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,进攻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Attack!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.96,0:04:12.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,集合\N{\fnArial\fs30}Attend!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.93,0:04:14.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,锻造神之节即将到来\N{\fnArial\fs30}The vulcanalia is announced!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.03,0:04:19.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,锻造神之节\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vulcanalia?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.90,0:04:21.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了纪念火神伏尔肯的节日\N{\fnArial\fs30}A festival to ward off wildfires.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.77,0:04:26.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,在今年的锻造神之节 巴蒂塔斯主人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dominus Batiatus has seen fit to fight twenty{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.98,0:04:29.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,决定派二十个人参加\N{\fnArial\fs30}at this year's Vulcanalia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.71,0:04:33.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是献给卡普亚人民的礼物\N{\fnArial\fs30}His gift to the people of Capua!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.12,0:04:35.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,等级最低的竞技清晨开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our lowest shall fight at dawn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.75,0:04:37.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,之后还有八组\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eight pairs to follow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.92,0:04:41.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,而之后 主人会有请他的骁将\N{\fnArial\fs30}After which your master will present his primus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.23,0:04:47.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,最强的两人 进入竞技场决斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two of our finest to meet in the arena!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.30,0:04:50.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,会有克雷斯 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crixus then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.93,0:04:52.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定有他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crixus certainly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.34,0:04:55.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的对手呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And his opponent?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.54,0:04:58.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,和卡普亚的冠军决斗必死无疑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Against the champion of Capua?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.54,0:05:00.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,是谁又有什么关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}What would it matter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.76,0:05:14.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,二十个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Twenty men{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.49,0:05:17.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了锻造神之节我奉献出了二十个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I pledge twenty men to fill the ranks of the Vulcanalia{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.26,0:05:20.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,自掏腰包赚吆喝\N{\fnArial\fs30}my own coin to see each victor paid{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.56,0:05:22.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我又能从行政官那里得到什么好处呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}what thanks do I get from the magistrate?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.03,0:05:24.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还说由于「某些急事」\N{\fnArial\fs30}He fears he will be unable to attend our reception{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.90,0:05:28.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能无法参加我们决赛前的欢迎晚宴\N{\fnArial\fs30}on the eve of the games due to "Pressing concerns"!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.24,0:05:29.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么急事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of what sort?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.87,0:05:32.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,听说是他要和索罗尼斯一起进餐\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hear rumor he dines with solonius instead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.31,0:05:33.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,索罗尼斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Solonius?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.94,0:05:37.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是节日上他连一个人都没有派\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he offers not one man for the Vulcanalia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.45,0:05:39.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,而他却依旧光天化日的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet his tongue still manages to find his way{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.12,0:05:41.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,拍行政官的马屁\N{\fnArial\fs30}to the magistrate's asshole.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.45,0:05:43.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,是新做的发型吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that new?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.99,0:05:47.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,为欢迎晚宴准备的\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the reception yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.12,0:05:50.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,为晚宴花费越来越多 很烦恼\N{\fnArial\fs30}The rising cost of this thing raises concern.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.13,0:05:52.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,机难轻失\N{\fnArial\fs30}It raises opportunity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.96,0:05:53.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}I question not its import.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.96,0:05:56.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过花费太大了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I question its scale.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.37,0:05:57.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这场干旱让我们山穷水尽了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This drought has stretched our resources thin{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.97,0:05:59.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在行政官又不出席…\N{\fnArial\fs30}and now without the attendance of the magistrate…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.74,0:06:04.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 小财不出大财不入\N{\fnArial\fs30}Darling you must spend coins to receive coins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.94,0:06:07.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是你教我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}My husband taught me that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.14,0:06:08.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是一个聪明人\N{\fnArial\fs30}A wise man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.24,0:06:10.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你成算在心\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has his moments.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.35,0:06:12.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,而这次也不会例外\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this will be one of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.65,0:06:13.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会克服万难\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll delight and astound{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.05,0:06:16.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,重振威风的\N{\fnArial\fs30}securing business for the year to come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.09,0:06:18.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许还可以诱惑葛雷博的妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}And perhaps even tempt Glaber's wife{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.25,0:06:20.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,让她给你赞助\N{\fnArial\fs30}to take up the cause of patronage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.16,0:06:21.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊莉西娅吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ilithyia?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.66,0:06:22.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为她还在罗马\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought she was still in rome{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.66,0:06:24.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,陪她那个忘恩负义的丈夫呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}with that ungrateful husband of hers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.29,0:06:27.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,她为了看竞技偷跑过来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She returns absent him for the games.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.40,0:06:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,她对角斗士们兴趣盎然\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's acquiring quite a taste for them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.67,0:06:31.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以投其所好\N{\fnArial\fs30}One which I shall nourish to advantage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.54,0:06:34.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,新发色很适合你\N{\fnArial\fs30}This new color suites you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.90,0:06:37.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,想让我把其他地方的毛发也染了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh shall I dye the rest to match?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.73,0:06:58.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,那只鸟应该被抓来吃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bird would be better served in my bowl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.80,0:07:03.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,那它就是你最后的晚餐了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Odds the meal would be your last.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.07,0:07:05.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴尔卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Barca?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.20,0:07:07.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,他空有其表\N{\fnArial\fs30}He stands but tall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.04,0:07:09.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,他满负盛名\N{\fnArial\fs30}He stands a legend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.88,0:07:14.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,迦太基被罗马打败后\N{\fnArial\fs30}After Carthage suffered defeat by the romans{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.58,0:07:16.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,数以百计的迦太基人\N{\fnArial\fs30}they forced hundreds of his people{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.38,0:07:18.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,在竞技场内被迫自相残杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}to fight against each other in the arena.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.48,0:07:24.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,半天之后 只有两人幸存\N{\fnArial\fs30}Half a day passed and only two remained…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.96,0:07:32.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴尔卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Barca.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.26,0:07:33.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,和他们的酋长\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the chief of his people{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.37,0:07:37.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,著名的玛格\N{\fnArial\fs30}The noble Mago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.14,0:07:43.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛格拥有精湛的武艺\N{\fnArial\fs30}Skill and the testament of years were his allies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.18,0:07:51.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴尔卡的优势则是年轻力胜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strength and youth Barca's.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.28,0:07:56.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,终于 玛格倒下了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mago fell to his knees…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.36,0:08:04.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴尔卡变成了迦太基的猛兽\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Barca became the beast of Carthage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.10,0:08:10.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他只不过送一个老家伙归西了而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}He sent an old man on his way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.07,0:08:12.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛格是所向匹敌的骁勇斗士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mago was a warrior fierce renown.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.64,0:08:14.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,多少次血战沙场\N{\fnArial\fs30}A chief upon a throne of blood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.51,0:08:20.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,据说 他还是巴尔卡的父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was also Barca's father as the story tells.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.95,0:08:28.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,是事实吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it true?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.45,0:08:30.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,在角斗士的世界里\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the world of the gladiator{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.35,0:08:32.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有威名和荣耀才能铸就事实\N{\fnArial\fs30}A man's fame and glory constructs its own truth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.82,0:08:36.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,威名和荣耀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fame and glory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.13,0:08:40.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,二者我都无心追觅\N{\fnArial\fs30}I seek neither.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.23,0:08:44.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是为财 像我一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coin then. Like me…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.80,0:08:46.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,开门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open the gates.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.30,0:08:48.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,让守卫各就各位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have the guard ready.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.61,0:08:52.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,稍等 主人\N{\fnArial\fs30}A moment dominus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.94,0:08:56.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ten paces.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.01,0:08:59.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,有我妻子的消息吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there any news of my wife?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.88,0:09:01.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,她被卖给了一个叙利亚商人\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was indeed sold to a Syrian merchant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.95,0:09:03.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你找到她了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You found her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.22,0:09:05.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,听说她现在在奥伦特河的渡船上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have cause to believe she sails upon the Orontes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.99,0:09:06.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是要去大马士革了\N{\fnArial\fs30}To damascus then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.06,0:09:09.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,或是安提俄克（古叙利亚首都）\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or perhaps Antioch?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.29,0:09:12.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你当我他妈的是指向标啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do I appear a fucking arrow my nose pointing towards{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.26,0:09:13.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,能直指你老婆那淫液肆虐的大腿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your wife's dripping thighs!?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.93,0:09:15.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,别不知好歹\N{\fnArial\fs30}You press beyond position!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.87,0:09:17.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,主人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dominus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.30,0:09:18.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只需知道 搜寻还在继续\N{\fnArial\fs30}The search continues that's all you need to know{\r}
