Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.05,0:11:19.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.69,0:11:21.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想被丢到矿区吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you dream of the mines?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.82,0:11:24.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我脑子里只有浴血奋战 多科特\N{\fnArial\fs30}My focus is on blood and battle doctore.{\r}
