Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.41,0:12:52.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续训练\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back to training.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.08,0:12:57.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在这片土地有色雷斯的味道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The sand smells like Thrace.{\r}
