Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.86,0:13:37.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.16,0:13:38.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.63,0:13:39.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你服侍主人多久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long have you served domina?{\r}
