Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.13,0:14:15.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实我不喜欢看竞技\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not favor the games.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.07,0:14:19.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可很罕见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well that is an odd bent{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.74,0:14:23.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤其对一个奴隶而言\N{\fnArial\fs30}For a slave{\r}
