Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.45,0:15:07.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想让人怀疑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not want to arouse the suspicions{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.82,0:15:09.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来此的目的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of my men as to my purpose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.59,0:15:13.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你目的何在呢 卡普亚的冠军\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what might that be oh champion of Capua?{\r}
