Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.18,0:17:20.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能我是冒失了点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps I spoke out of turn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.08,0:17:22.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.45,0:17:25.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为你勇敢 看来只是鲁莽\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I perceived as courage in you reveals itself foolishness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.25,0:17:28.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,在竞技场上求饶 我办不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}To surrender in the arena…I cannot do.{\r}
