Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.46,0:18:37.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}As is mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.03,0:18:40.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,花两年时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two years here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.36,0:18:41.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,用我的奖金还清债务\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pay my debts with the winnings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.83,0:18:43.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就会重返她身边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold her in my arms again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.77,0:18:48.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,这身污秽到时候肯定能洗干净了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps the smell will have washed off by then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.38,0:18:56.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,她叫什么名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}What name do you call her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.88,0:18:59.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥瑞莉娅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aurelia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.45,0:19:01.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你妻子呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yours?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.65,0:19:03.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,苏拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sura.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.65,0:19:06.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.52,0:19:09.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么泡粪澡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Buried up to your balls in garbage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.56,0:19:12.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你与苏拉团聚的计划之一吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is part of your plan to get sura back?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.54,0:19:21.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这么点供给水 都拿去洗这小布条\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'd waste your ration cleaning a bit of cloth?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.47,0:19:26.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,这布条对我很重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}It bears meaning to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.58,0:19:32.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,集合\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gather.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.19,0:19:38.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,经过主人的慎重考虑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your master's hand has been at work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.75,0:19:41.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,拟定了锻造神之节的对阵名单\N{\fnArial\fs30}The pairings of the vulcanalia have been decided.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.13,0:19:45.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,克雷斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crixus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.93,0:19:48.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡普亚的不败战神\N{\fnArial\fs30}The unbeaten champion of capua.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.83,0:19:51.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你将代表巴蒂塔斯家族\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will honor the house of batiatus{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.17,0:19:53.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,担任骁将\N{\fnArial\fs30}By fighting in his primus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.37,0:19:55.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁与我对阵 多科特\N{\fnArial\fs30}And who will challenge me doctore?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.88,0:20:03.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,此人技艺高超 兢兢业业\N{\fnArial\fs30}A man of skill and dedication.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.55,0:20:06.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的能力 他的刻苦 及对胜利的欲望\N{\fnArial\fs30}His ability his hard work and his hunger{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.88,0:20:09.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,必须得到奖赏与满足\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shall be rewarded.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.62,0:20:11.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼亚斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gnaeus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.39,0:20:16.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,英雄相见 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}At last we meet brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.46,0:20:19.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,撑着点 别太早翘辫子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't die to quickly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.23,0:20:22.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.06,0:20:24.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会奸了你的尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will fuck your corpse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.64,0:20:27.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要用啥奸\N{\fnArial\fs30}With what cock?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.87,0:20:32.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,余下名单由阿舒尔公布\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ashur carries the remainder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.84,0:20:34.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,神明与你们同在\N{\fnArial\fs30}May the gods be with you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.41,0:20:38.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个一个来\N{\fnArial\fs30}One by one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.55,0:20:39.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个一个来 兔崽子们\N{\fnArial\fs30}One by one you fucking cunts!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.98,0:20:41.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可是巴蒂塔斯亲手交给我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Batiatus himself handed me this list…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.35,0:20:43.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,贱人 拿来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give it here shit fuck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.09,0:20:48.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,野蛮的家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Savages.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.13,0:20:53.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,操\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fucking cock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.53,0:20:58.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me see it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.67,0:21:01.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give it here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.80,0:21:04.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会上场吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you gain position?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.31,0:21:06.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟你一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}As did you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.71,0:21:11.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们俩对阵 打头炮\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are set to fight each other at the start of the games.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.21,0:21:13.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一场\N{\fnArial\fs30}The first match?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.88,0:21:16.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们当无名小卒\N{\fnArial\fs30}The slot of the meek and insubstantial!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.62,0:21:17.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就得证明我们不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}We shall prove otherwise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.85,0:21:19.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}To what aim?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.42,0:21:21.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,胜者奖金不过半文钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}The victor's purse won't be more than half a coin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.72,0:21:22.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么点\N{\fnArial\fs30}So little?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.79,0:21:24.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,对我们俩的情况根本是于事无补\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not enough for either of our causes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.59,0:21:25.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果是作为骁将呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And for the primus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.06,0:21:27.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,会多很多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Considerably more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.73,0:21:31.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,测试的时候 我打败过克雷斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I already bested crixus once in the final test.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.10,0:21:32.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我得再一路杀过这些废物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I must fight my way up through the dregs{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.67,0:21:34.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,才能再次和他对阵\N{\fnArial\fs30}To face him again?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.14,0:21:35.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,说我是废物吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dregs am I?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.20,0:21:37.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我的意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know my meaning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.94,0:21:38.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果不是巴蒂塔斯阻止我\N{\fnArial\fs30}If batiatus hadn't stayed my hand{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.04,0:21:41.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我早让他身首异处了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would have parted his brains from his skull.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.04,0:21:44.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和克雷斯没什么过结\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is no love lost between myself and crixus…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.38,0:21:49.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是提醒一句 他可是危险人物\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I caution he's dangerous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.82,0:21:52.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,他到底哪来的名声\N{\fnArial\fs30}A reputation built on what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.76,0:21:55.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,对阵挥舞小渔网的尼亚斯之流吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Facing men such as gnaeus and his little net?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.96,0:21:59.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,克雷斯打败的可是大人物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crixus forged his reputation against far worse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.09,0:22:02.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,完全是来自地狱的恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Demons belched from the underworld.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.63,0:22:04.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,加根兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}the gargan twins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.47,0:22:09.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,德修斯和提比略\N{\fnArial\fs30}Decimus and tiberius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.27,0:22:11.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,豺狼之子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sons of a whore raped by a jackel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.47,0:22:13.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,人面兽心\N{\fnArial\fs30}More beasts than men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.91,0:22:16.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直以来是东部沿海人的心头大患\N{\fnArial\fs30}They terrorized the eastern seaboard for many years{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.15,0:22:18.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到他们被捕获\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until their capture.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.21,0:22:19.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,本想让他们葬身竞技场\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were cast into the arena to die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.55,0:22:22.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,反倒满足了他们杀戮的欲望\N{\fnArial\fs30}But instead flourished on meals of bone and blood…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.69,0:22:33.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些壮汉还没失去意识就被大卸八块\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bodies of stout men left in their wake half devoured.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.86,0:22:36.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人敢自愿挑战他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one dared face them willingly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.10,0:22:37.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,唯有一人例外\N{\fnArial\fs30}Except for one…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.50,0:22:40.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡普亚的冠军 克雷斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crixus! Champion of capua!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.47,0:22:44.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,血流成河 吼声震天\N{\fnArial\fs30}The blood flowed. The crowd roared.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.04,0:22:47.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,恶魔全都倒在他剑下\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the demons fell beneath his sword…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.67,0:23:12.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,豺狼之子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The sons of a jackal?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.54,0:23:16.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,传闻如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}So they say.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.97,0:23:19.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,这故事真荒谬\N{\fnArial\fs30}The story is a jest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.04,0:23:23.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像克雷斯一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like Crixus himself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.15,0:23:24.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听说过吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you hear this one?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.95,0:23:30.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许有一天你能证明自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}One day maybe you prove yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.39,0:23:33.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,但之前 你只配在早场跟那些废物过招\N{\fnArial\fs30}'til then you fight at dawn with the rest of the shitwhores.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.88,0:24:02.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我与强大的斯巴达克斯并驾齐驱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I keep pace with the mighty Spartacus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.18,0:24:03.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,还当我是废物吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still place my worth among the dregs?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.02,0:24:05.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说错话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I misspoke.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.06,0:24:07.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要打一场 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}A theme with you is it not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.99,0:24:09.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会称你为对手\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shall call you equal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.86,0:24:12.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,其它的你要自己争取\N{\fnArial\fs30}More will need to be earned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.53,0:24:14.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,会是场精彩的对决\N{\fnArial\fs30}It will be a good fight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.50,0:24:16.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,愿神明保佑我们都活下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}May the gods see us both survive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.83,0:24:19.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里很多人都会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are many I would see dead in this place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.10,0:24:21.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不在其中\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are not among them though.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.97,0:24:24.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你别无选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}You may not have a choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.87,0:24:26.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,船到桥头自然直\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is always a choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.58,0:24:37.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的表情让人担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}That look gives me worry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.52,0:24:41.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我妻子经常这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Words I've heard often from my wife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.23,0:24:50.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的对手可真是个人物啊 尼亚斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your net's aim is remarkably true Gnaeus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.70,0:24:55.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的动作相当漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}You strike an impressive figure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.64,0:24:58.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,可惜只是对付个小木人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Battling that little wooden man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.24,0:25:02.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真想见识你场上的雄姿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I long to see you in the arena.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.88,0:25:06.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟货真价实的角斗士决斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Among the men there you are…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.28,0:25:08.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,手里拿着一张可怕的网子\N{\fnArial\fs30}With your fearsome net!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.68,0:25:12.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,像个骚娘们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like a young wet girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.69,0:25:15.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,兔崽子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fucking cunt!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.53,0:25:27.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,骄阳把尼亚斯烤疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The sun has made Gnaeus mad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.87,0:25:29.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,他像头发狂的山羊冲过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}He charged like crazed goat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.61,0:25:31.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到他的眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw his eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.31,0:25:32.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,燃烧着狂野与饥渴\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were wild with thirst.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.21,0:25:37.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴尔卡 柯泽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Barca! Kerza!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.55,0:25:40.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,照顾尼亚斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tend to Gnaeus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.45,0:25:42.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续训练\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back to work!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.07,0:26:05.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿舒尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ashur.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.24,0:26:10.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要你帮我弄点东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is something I want you to get for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.45,0:26:14.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管你要什么 阿舒尔都能搞到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever your needs Ashur provides.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.72,0:26:19.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,换地方说话 防奸细之耳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Follow me away from prying ears…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.91,0:26:43.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来我必须与你划清界限\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must make a point to stop standing beside you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.41,0:26:48.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼亚斯暴躁鲁莽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gnaeus was of an unsteady nature.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.32,0:26:50.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你想取代尼亚斯出场\N{\fnArial\fs30}If your intent was to claim Gnaeus' berth in the primus{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.55,0:26:52.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就太傻了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're a fool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.55,0:26:54.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他干了五年才获此殊荣\N{\fnArial\fs30}He served five years before he was afforded the privilege.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.09,0:27:00.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,苏拉可等不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sura cannot afford years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.70,0:27:02.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你在竞技场\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nor your death{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.66,0:27:03.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,对上了克雷斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}which is surely your station{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.73,0:27:05.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就小命不保了\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you face Crixus in the arena.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.57,0:27:08.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,角斗士们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gladiators!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.37,0:27:09.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,观众已经到场\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your public has arrived.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.97,0:27:12.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,快换衣服\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dress quickly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.27,0:27:13.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚宴开始了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The reception begins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.39,0:27:27.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,克雷斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crixus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.89,0:27:30.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,让亲爱的蒙卡图好好看看你的剑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let good mercato have a closer look at your sword.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.89,0:27:32.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,遵命主人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dominus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.26,0:27:39.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这把剑砍倒了德修斯和提比略\N{\fnArial\fs30}The very blade used to strike down tiberius and decimus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.44,0:27:44.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你想为卡普亚增光添彩\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you were to bestow capua with the gift of a munus{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.54,0:27:47.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有什么比下注克雷斯更好的呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}what better means than securing Crixus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.38,0:27:49.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果连同我其他的角斗士一并下注\N{\fnArial\fs30}Along with a dozen or so of my other offerings{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.41,0:27:52.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,就更完美了\N{\fnArial\fs30}to round out the proceedings?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.08,0:27:54.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,看在好友的面子上 我会好好考虑的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have been contemplating games in honor of my good friend…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.75,0:27:56.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿舒尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ashur!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.32,0:27:57.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的蒙卡图有意全程下注\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good mercato has set his mind to a day of games.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.05,0:27:59.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来负责满足他的要求 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let us see his order well filled…Shall we?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.93,0:28:04.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 真是又热又燥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ahh the dust and the heat{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.76,0:28:07.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,越来越难受\N{\fnArial\fs30}it worsens by the hour.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.13,0:28:09.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不是有比赛 我这会就在罗马\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd yet be in rome if it weren't for the games.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.30,0:28:10.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定要去罗马看我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must promise to visit while I'm here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.90,0:28:13.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我父亲的公馆太无趣了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My father's villa is beyond depressing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.40,0:28:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你丈夫不能来真是太遗憾了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's unfortunate your husband couldn't join you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.07,0:28:16.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,将军近来可好\N{\fnArial\fs30}How fares the legatus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.04,0:28:18.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,在闹脾气\N{\fnArial\fs30}In a mood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.97,0:28:20.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,自打从色雷斯回来后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since his return from thrace{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.38,0:28:22.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,元老院就成了他的情妇\N{\fnArial\fs30}The senate has become his mistress.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.48,0:28:24.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,还对他欲求不满\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her demands on him are boundless.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.31,0:28:26.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,男人都有野心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Men and their ambitions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.55,0:28:27.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们该学会欣赏\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know they should learn to appreciate{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.55,0:28:29.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,更美好的事物\N{\fnArial\fs30}The finer things in life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.95,0:28:35.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,这条项链 我非常喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}That necklace. I adore it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.22,0:28:36.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.29,0:28:37.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,地摊货\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a trinket.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.66,0:28:40.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也有一条类似的 从拉麦尔那里买的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It calls to mind a piece I had from Ramel one season.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.03,0:28:42.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,那时候翡翠正流行\N{\fnArial\fs30}When emerald was still the fashion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.00,0:28:48.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听说现在又开始流行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hear it's coming back around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.10,0:28:51.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我该把那条翻出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Perhaps I'll root mine out then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.57,0:28:54.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,新老朋友们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Friends old and new!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.34,0:28:56.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,由衷地感谢各位今晚光临\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gratitude for honoring the storied ludus of Batiatus{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.01,0:28:59.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的著名的训练场\N{\fnArial\fs30}with your presence this eve.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.28,0:29:03.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天的锻造神之节竞技场上将会精彩纷呈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tomorrow's vulcanalia promises many glories in the arena.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.89,0:29:05.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是今晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}But tonight…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.39,0:29:09.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,请允许我介绍共和国内最优秀的角斗士\N{\fnArial\fs30}May I present to you the finest gladiators in all the republic!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.86,0:29:17.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,远观\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.13,0:29:18.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,亵玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Touch!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.97,0:29:22.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,感受这上好的货色\N{\fnArial\fs30}Feel the quality of the stock!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.24,0:29:24.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,挑你们喜欢的下注\N{\fnArial\fs30}Place your orders for any of the men you covet!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.18,0:29:28.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 别害羞 他们不咬人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come! Don't be bashful they won't bite!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.11,0:29:32.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是真咬了 就打九折\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if they do a ten percent discount!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.82,0:29:44.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都喜欢我们的色雷斯人 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}The crowd fancies our thracian don't they?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.96,0:29:48.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,仅仅因为他对抗索罗尼斯的角斗士出名\N{\fnArial\fs30}A curiosity born of his fortune against solonius' men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.30,0:29:51.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人喜欢总好过无人问津\N{\fnArial\fs30}Better curiosity than indifference!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.23,0:29:52.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我们能把他们的兴趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps we could fuel this interest{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.80,0:29:55.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,变成万贯金银\N{\fnArial\fs30}Into a conflagration of coin…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.94,0:29:57.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,由于尼亚斯颅骨受伤无法上场\N{\fnArial\fs30}With Gnaeus of questionable skull{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.41,0:30:00.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得让斯巴达克斯代表骁将出战如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}what make you of Spartacus as replacement in our primus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.88,0:30:04.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,恕我直言 万众期待一场精彩绝伦的竞技\N{\fnArial\fs30}With respect dominus the public seeks an honorable fight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.85,0:30:06.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯还不够火候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus is yet the animal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.45,0:30:10.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会考虑的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um well I'll think on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.52,0:30:11.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,距离竞技赛开赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}One day though.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.55,0:30:13.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有一天时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}A contest to be promoted…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.76,0:30:20.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,孤身一人\N{\fnArial\fs30}A moment alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.23,0:30:23.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,对于一个受万众崇拜的男人 真是稀奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}A rarity for a man with such an adoring public huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.67,0:30:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么进入正题\N{\fnArial\fs30}To business then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.27,0:30:29.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是临时下达的一个任务 十分艰巨\N{\fnArial\fs30}A difficult task on short notice yet…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.51,0:30:33.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,将其完成\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carried to completion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.22,0:30:43.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,真操蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cock fucker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.65,0:30:48.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个高卢人真是赏心悦目\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Gaul is of a fine cut is he not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.46,0:30:51.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,前无古人 后无来者\N{\fnArial\fs30}None finer in all the republic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.36,0:30:53.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是雄姿英发\N{\fnArial\fs30}Such a man…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.47,0:31:01.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我十分期待在竞技场上一睹他的风采\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tremble to see him again at the arena…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.87,0:31:03.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,彼此彼此\N{\fnArial\fs30}As do we all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.23,0:31:18.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个色雷斯人居然还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Thracian yet lives?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.55,0:31:21.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,暂时而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}For now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.66,0:31:26.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有什么更有趣的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there nothing more of interest to see?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.03,0:31:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不久之后我丈夫就会指名骁将了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well my husband will shortly announce his primus{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.66,0:31:31.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且还有充足的美酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}and there's is ample wine…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.87,0:31:34.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对这些毫无兴趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}I fear it already beckons my sleep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.84,0:31:40.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许我该离开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps I'd best take leave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.98,0:31:43.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.41,0:31:47.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想还有一件事会让你乐在其中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course there is one thing that I thought you might enjoy{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.82,0:31:51.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于一些男女之事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Its something of a much more physical nature.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.12,0:31:53.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.89,0:31:54.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.72,0:32:26.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我赌五第纳尔 他撑不过二十下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five denarii says he doesn't last another twenty strokes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.06,0:32:36.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还从没见过角斗士做爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never seen a gladiator fuck before…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.37,0:32:40.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,看那猛烈的撞击\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at the way he rams her!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.41,0:32:45.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,像发怒的公牛一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like an enraged bull!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.57,0:32:47.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,角斗士的过人之处\N{\fnArial\fs30}A gladiator's virtues extends well beyond{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.61,0:32:50.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,数之不尽\N{\fnArial\fs30}the sands of the arena.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.51,0:32:53.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,作为情人 他们就是饥渴难耐的野兽\N{\fnArial\fs30}As lovers they are said to be ravenous beasts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.92,0:32:55.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,用手感觉一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can touch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.02,0:33:03.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,原谅我 奥瑞莉娅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh forgive me Aurelia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.16,0:33:05.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会让人欲仙欲死\N{\fnArial\fs30}They provide unimaginable pleasures…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.94,0:33:22.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他能再做一次吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can he do it again?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.31,0:33:23.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他再做一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make him do it again!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.55,0:33:28.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Proceed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.76,0:33:34.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 我们意见一致了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we are in agreement.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.06,0:33:36.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,毛鲁斯会迎战克雷斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rabanus will meet Crixus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.42,0:33:38.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,让汉米卡填补空缺\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move Hamilcar up to fill the void.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.43,0:33:49.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听说巴蒂塔斯和多科特在开会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I overheard Batiatus and Doctore in conference.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.57,0:33:52.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于骁将之名落入谁手\N{\fnArial\fs30}The primus their intent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.37,0:33:54.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个撒丁人要对战克雷斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Sardinian is to face Crixus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.55,0:33:59.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个消息对我的现状也于事无补\N{\fnArial\fs30}The news does not balance my cause.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.15,0:34:08.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管你在想什么 死心吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever your thoughts cast them out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.89,0:34:11.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,敬爱的子民们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good citizens!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.06,0:34:13.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位尽享了美味佳肴\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've enjoyed my food!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.66,0:34:15.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,醇香美酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}My wine!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.46,0:34:18.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,还目睹了我倾国倾城的妻子的美貌\N{\fnArial\fs30}The aphrodisiac presence of my beautiful wife!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.70,0:34:21.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在请屏息期待明日的骁将人选\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now marvel at the announcing of tomorrow's primus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.77,0:34:25.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,克雷斯 卡普亚的冠军\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crixus the champion of Capua{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.91,0:34:28.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,将在沙场上与其抗衡的是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}will stride across the sands and face…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.22,0:34:35.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.82,0:34:38.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 让他们打\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! Let them fight!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.37,0:34:51.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enough!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.41,0:34:59.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要将你碎尸万段\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will take your fucking heart!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.98,0:35:01.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,放马过来 你个孬种\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come and take it coward!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.65,0:35:16.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,仇恨使其怒火中烧 锐不可当\N{\fnArial\fs30}See their hatred burning beyond control!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.73,0:35:20.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,今日点到为止 且等明日\N{\fnArial\fs30}This was merely a taste!Tomorrow{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.29,0:35:24.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,看其沙场之上 短兵相接\N{\fnArial\fs30}they will settle this grudge in the arena!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.60,0:35:32.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,克雷斯 无往不胜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crixus the undefeated!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.77,0:35:37.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯 逆天而行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus the dog who defies death!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.45,0:35:42.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,世纪之战\N{\fnArial\fs30}A fight for the ages!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.55,0:35:44.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡普亚之荣耀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glory to capua!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.05,0:35:46.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗马之荣耀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glory to rome!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.84,0:36:05.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚宴几乎被他毁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The reception nearly ruined{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.32,0:36:06.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,而对他的处罚是什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}and what is his punishment?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.88,0:36:08.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,居然让他当骁将\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fucking primus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.21,0:36:09.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听到众人的呼声了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You heard the crowd.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.61,0:36:11.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做出了最合情合理的决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}I made the best of a situation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.21,0:36:14.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个色雷斯人根本没有作为角斗士出战过\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Thracian has yet to stand a single match as gladiator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.42,0:36:16.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么众人之中选他来迎战克雷斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why leap him ahead of all others to face Crixus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.79,0:36:19.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他挑起了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because of what he possesses.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.29,0:36:21.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,民众的兴致\N{\fnArial\fs30}The public's interest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.19,0:36:22.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们居然对条疯狗宠爱有加\N{\fnArial\fs30}They stroke a rabid dog.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.79,0:36:23.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯让众人为之震撼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus has struck a chord.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.79,0:36:26.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我打算最大限度地利用这点 从中获利\N{\fnArial\fs30}I intend to maximize its profit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.66,0:36:30.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的行为反复无常 他藐视规则\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's unpredictable he has no regard for rules{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.80,0:36:32.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,目中无人 如果克雷斯出什么意外的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}or for honor and if something happens to Crixus…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.73,0:36:34.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,他对克雷斯构不成任何威胁\N{\fnArial\fs30}He poses no threat to Crixus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.64,0:36:35.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家对他只是一时兴起\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is but a novelty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.77,0:36:38.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,热度过后 自然将他抛之脑后\N{\fnArial\fs30}To be used and discarded after a purpose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.27,0:36:40.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,他妈的 没有酒了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fucking god's cock is there no wine left!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.68,0:36:44.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还愣在那干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well what are you standing there for{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.68,0:36:45.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,去拿酒啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}go and get some fucking wine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.80,0:37:02.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apologies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.43,0:37:03.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没想吓你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did not mean to startle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.00,0:37:14.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们上一次谈话 我并无冒犯之意\N{\fnArial\fs30}When we spoke last I meant no offense.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.54,0:37:17.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我擅长舞刀弄枪 不会舞文弄墨\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am practiced with sword not words.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.71,0:37:19.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果主人发现我打破了最后一壶酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}If domina discovers I dropped the last jug…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.91,0:37:21.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,把碎片给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hand me the pieces.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.68,0:37:22.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会把它们处理掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll see them over the cliff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.17,0:37:38.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.04,0:37:47.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,借此物以表达我难以言喻之情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps this gift will explain where words fail.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.21,0:37:52.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,请收下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.18,0:38:26.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在试着作出决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm trying to decide.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.05,0:38:28.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,决定什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Upon what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.02,0:38:32.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝贺你还是悼念你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Congratulations or condolences.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.39,0:38:34.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你痛打了克雷斯 是因为\N{\fnArial\fs30}You may have bested Crixus once by tripping him{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.32,0:38:37.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,他毫无防备\N{\fnArial\fs30}with that bit of cloth{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.12,0:38:39.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,可在竞技场上与其对战\N{\fnArial\fs30}But to face him in the arena…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.66,0:38:42.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我坚信他徒有虚名\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe his reputation inflated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.80,0:38:46.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天我会证明这点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tomorrow I shall prove it so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.33,0:38:49.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,接下来你会吹牛说 瑟奥科斯也是手下败将\N{\fnArial\fs30}Next he'll boast he can defeat Theokoles himself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.10,0:38:51.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.31,0:38:52.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,前提是我得认识他\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I knew the man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.58,0:38:56.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑟奥科斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Theokoles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.54,0:38:57.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,死亡之影\N{\fnArial\fs30}The shadow of death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.01,0:39:00.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,他对竞技场不屑一顾\N{\fnArial\fs30}He speaks so brazenly of the arena{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.55,0:39:02.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,他对其历史一无所知\N{\fnArial\fs30}He knows nothing of its history.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.75,0:39:08.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑟奥科斯并非凡人 色雷斯人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Theokoles is no man Thracian.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.86,0:39:12.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,他完全是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is something else entirely…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.86,0:39:18.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,传说他有十英尺高\N{\fnArial\fs30}They say he stand over ten feet tall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.57,0:39:22.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,所到之处 地动山摇\N{\fnArial\fs30}The very ground trembles at his feet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.37,0:39:25.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,月残日殇\N{\fnArial\fs30}His shadow eclipsing the sun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.97,0:39:29.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,许多人光是见他一面就已被吓死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Most men fall dead at the sight of the giant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.04,0:39:32.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们算是幸运的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are the fortunate ones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.56,0:39:43.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我父亲说与「死亡之影」\N{\fnArial\fs30}My father tells of a munus{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.22,0:39:44.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,交过手的角斗士超过百人\N{\fnArial\fs30}in which the shadow fought over a hundred men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.93,0:39:49.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,可他们无一生还\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not one survived.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.70,0:39:55.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,那只是一个传说 吓唬小孩子的\N{\fnArial\fs30}A tale to frighten children.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.84,0:40:00.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑟奥科斯不是传说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Theokoles is no legend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.04,0:40:02.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还活跃在竞技场上的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before he retired from the arena{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.18,0:40:05.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,与他交手过的只有一人生还\N{\fnArial\fs30}only one man ever faced him and lived.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.01,0:40:08.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个人就在我们中间\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he breathes among us{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.38,0:40:11.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就是鞭打我们的多科特\N{\fnArial\fs30}his whip ever at our backs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.95,0:40:16.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在可不是闲话家常的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now is not the hour for idle talk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.36,0:40:19.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天你们将奔赴竞技场\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tomorrow you step into the arena.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.96,0:40:23.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们中的许多人是首次登台\N{\fnArial\fs30}Many for the first time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.20,0:40:25.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,对于有些人 可能也是最后一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}For some perhaps the last.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.05,0:40:47.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们为鲜血欢呼\N{\fnArial\fs30}They cheer for blood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.25,0:40:48.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会让他们得偿所愿的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they shall have it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.26,0:40:55.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,愿神明保佑你 正如今早我被他们护佑一般\N{\fnArial\fs30}May the gods bring you fortune as they did me this morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.47,0:41:00.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,苏拉信仰神明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sura believed in the gods.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.74,0:41:06.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,可当罗马人要带走她的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when the Romans took her{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.51,0:41:10.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,可没有哪位神明出面加以阻挠\N{\fnArial\fs30}not one descended from the heavens to intervene.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.81,0:41:15.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,不久我将会纠正他们所犯下的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shall correct their mistake presently.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.96,0:41:22.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信你做的到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe you will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.70,0:41:33.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,人们喜欢你安排的这些比赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}The crowd favors your offerings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.50,0:41:35.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 这是一场精彩的演出\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes a fine showing all around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.47,0:41:37.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴蒂塔斯 卡普亚以你为豪\N{\fnArial\fs30}You honor our fair city Batiatus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.54,0:41:39.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很荣幸 行政官\N{\fnArial\fs30}The honor is mine magistrate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.34,0:41:41.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,恕我直言 我本以为这场比赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Truth told I feared the event would{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.93,0:41:43.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,将乏善可陈\N{\fnArial\fs30}pass without anything of note this year.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.84,0:41:45.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,要想诱使重量级的选手来此参加\N{\fnArial\fs30}Its very difficult to procure men of worth{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.31,0:41:48.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些小比赛并非易事\N{\fnArial\fs30}for these minor games.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.12,0:41:51.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,索罗尼斯的缺席使得这场比赛逊色不少\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good Solonius was already taken with loftier engagements.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.65,0:41:54.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,索罗尼斯明年或许能来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps Solonius will be available next year.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.36,0:41:56.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们唯有向上天祷告\N{\fnArial\fs30}One can but pray.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.36,0:42:02.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,早知道如此干旱 我就不回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps I was wrong to return absent the rain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.27,0:42:07.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,喝点水吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some water perhaps.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.84,0:42:09.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是喝点酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or maybe some wine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.67,0:42:12.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,一想到酒 我的胃里就翻江倒海\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uhh the thought churns the stomach.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.91,0:42:19.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过昨晚你的招待真是让我欢悦有加\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your company last night yet astounds the senses.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.51,0:42:20.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,过头了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too much?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.51,0:42:23.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果说酒的话 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of wine definitely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.42,0:42:25.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,至于其他的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of other interests…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.92,0:42:29.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是隔靴搔痒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think the surface barely scratched.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.66,0:42:34.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就喝点水吧 以缓解你目前的饥渴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some water then to slake your current thirst.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.24,0:42:43.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们开始吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here we go then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.31,0:42:48.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡普亚的子民们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good citizens of Capua!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.54,0:42:52.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很荣幸的向你们引荐\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is my great honor to introduce to you the primus{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.95,0:42:55.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴蒂塔斯的骁将\N{\fnArial\fs30}of Quintus Lentulus Batiatus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.20,0:43:10.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,色雷斯人进场\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enter Thraex!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.07,0:43:19.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,有请 斯巴达克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Behold Spartacus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.74,0:43:22.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯 斯巴达克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus! Spartacus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.84,0:43:24.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯 斯巴达克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus! Spartacus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.61,0:43:29.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,他以在阿比努斯元老的赛场上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Renowned for his magnificent victory{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.18,0:43:32.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,取得的斐然成绩而闻名于世\N{\fnArial\fs30}at the games of Senator Albinius!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.09,0:43:33.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,他单枪匹马\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where he single handedly{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.57,0:43:36.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,战胜了四名索罗尼斯的角斗士\N{\fnArial\fs30}slaughtered four of Solonius' gladiators!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.39,0:43:38.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,四名啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Four!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.66,0:43:44.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,姆尔米洛进场\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enter Murmillo!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.11,0:44:01.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的战绩世人有目共睹\N{\fnArial\fs30}The marvel before you needs no introduction!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.92,0:44:04.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,他以剑术精进\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's known by his sword!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.95,0:44:07.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,擅于用盾以及辉煌的战绩闻名于世\N{\fnArial\fs30}By his shield! By his glory!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.93,0:44:14.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,克雷斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crixus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.06,0:44:17.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡普亚的冠军\N{\fnArial\fs30}The champion of Capua!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.74,0:44:27.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我终于见到克雷斯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finally Crixus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.44,0:44:31.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧他在骄阳下的矫健身姿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look how his form catches the sun!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.48,0:44:36.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡普亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Capua!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.93,0:44:50.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡普亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Capua!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.00,0:44:57.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,以巴蒂塔斯和神圣的锻造神之节之名…\N{\fnArial\fs30}In honor of the name Batiatus and the sacred Vulcanalia…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.52,0:45:15.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的致辞尚未结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}You had not yet finished the oration{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.79,0:45:17.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个色雷斯人竟然开战了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and yet the Thracian attacks!?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.66,0:45:20.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道不该这样的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was that not supposed to happen?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.13,0:45:22.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 当然不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No it was not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.33,0:45:24.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,真刺激\N{\fnArial\fs30}How exciting…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.29,0:46:27.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,色雷斯人就这么点能耐吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that all the Thracian is capable of?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.76,0:46:30.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,看过他和索罗尼斯的手下决斗过以后\N{\fnArial\fs30}After what he did against Solonius' men{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.23,0:46:32.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对他可是寄予厚望啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had hoped for more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.63,0:47:41.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡普亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Capua!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.20,0:47:44.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我该继续吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shall I begin!?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.31,0:49:27.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的死期到了 色雷斯人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you die Thracian.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.81,0:49:30.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了他 杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill. Kill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.28,0:49:32.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了他 杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill kill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.55,0:49:37.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了他 杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill kill!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.82,0:50:49.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯的表现很精彩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus fought well!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.03,0:50:55.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他活命 日后再战吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let him live to fight another day!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.01,0:51:14.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,如此结局 真是扫兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}A sour bite to end the meal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.21,0:51:16.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apologies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.35,0:51:18.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在斯巴达克斯身上花了大价钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet Spartacus was of some cost to me…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.29,0:51:22.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已失去民心\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've already lost the crowd.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.40,0:51:31.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,竟然让他活下来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He lives?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.30,0:51:35.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,真没劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}How disappointing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.71,0:52:17.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他真是实至名归\N{\fnArial\fs30}His reputation is well earned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.31,0:52:19.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的战术无懈可击\N{\fnArial\fs30}My blade could find no weakness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.19,0:52:28.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,可他还是有漏洞的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And yet… it was there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.96,0:52:34.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有至少十处破绽 你本可以操胜券的\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least ten points where you could have seized advantage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.86,0:52:37.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的战技还需淬炼\N{\fnArial\fs30}You needed more training.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.94,0:52:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会加倍努力训练的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shall train harder then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.68,0:52:46.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,不必了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.24,0:52:50.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,为时已晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is too late for such things.{\r}
